  "about": {
    "title": "About the Undaunted set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Undaunted is a HeartGold & SoulSilver expansion released on 18 August 2010. It has 91 cards: 90 in the main set and 1 secret rare. There are also 80 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 90 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (170 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 171 cards, adding the 1 secret rare).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
